+    // Patched (sundar-gutka): surface a human-readable title on the system
+    // DownloadManager notification (Android <14 path). The JS layer puts the
+    // "<bani in Punjabi>  •  <artist in English>" string in metadata.groupName;
+    // without setTitle, DownloadManager labels the notification with the raw
